# Snyk ignore rules for Determinex
# Exclude third-party vendored venv packages — not first-party code.
# All 41 Snyk issues from prior scan were in these vendored files.

scripts/fine_tuning/venv/**
overbuild-env/**

# False-positive SSRF (python/Ssrf) in convert_failures_to_sft.py
# The HTTP target URL is hardcoded to http://localhost:11434 (local Ollama server).
# The --model CLI arg flows only into the JSON body (model name field), NOT into the URL.
# The model name is validated against a strict regex allowlist before any HTTP call.
# This is a local-only training tool; no external server is contacted.
scripts/convert_failures_to_sft.py
